+// SP/DP task completions: the audio and graphics task threads run concurrently (real hardware runs one
+// RSP task at a time), so two completions can arrive while the game's queue still holds one. Those must
+// not be dropped like a missed VI retrace, or the game waits forever for a task that already finished.
+void ultramodern::enqueue_external_message_keep(PTR(OSMesgQueue) mq, OSMesg msg) {
+    external_messages.enqueue({mq, msg, false, true});
+}
